# ============================================================
# Public release repository (GitHub -> Zenodo DOI)
#
# Tracked, as stated in the article's "Availability of data and materials":
#   00_dataset/maturity_corpus_v3.csv   Additional file 1: row-level dataset   (CC BY 4.0)
#   00_dataset/sources_37.csv           Additional file 2: source register     (CC BY 4.0)
#   01_analysis/out/group_map.csv       Additional file 3: group mapping       (CC BY 4.0)
#   01_analysis/out/                    derived results                        (CC BY 4.0)
#   03_figures/                         generated figures                      (CC BY 4.0)
#   01_analysis/*.py                    analysis code                          (MIT)
#   README.md, LICENSE, LICENSE-DATA
#
# The Zenodo-GitHub integration archives the tagged release as committed,
# so anything ignored here is also left out of the Zenodo deposit.
# ============================================================

# --- Written by the scripts when they run; used only to build the article
02_manuscript/

# --- Kept only in the private working repository (never publish)
